  "bodyHash": "EP48azRcNJ8=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔灌注台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 新增了一種附魔台，讓你能準確選擇要套用的附魔，不再依賴隨機結果。✨</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">基礎附魔灌注台專為直接附魔設計，而進階附魔灌注台則能修改現有附魔、用經驗等級修復物品，以及從不需要的附魔中回收經驗。🔮</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">書櫃的運作方式與原版附魔台完全相同，隨著你的佈置升級，可解鎖更強大的附魔。📚 費用、附魔可用性、寶藏附魔、修復機制及其他許多功能皆可完整設定，以符合你喜好的進階風格。🎛️</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">選擇你的附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">準確選擇要套用的附魔，無需依賴隨機附魔結果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">書櫃進度系統：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">圍繞灌注台建立附魔佈置，以解鎖更強大的附魔和更高級別。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">兩種灌注台等級：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用基礎灌注台進行直接附魔，或升級至進階灌注台以獲得額外功能和更低費用。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">修改現有裝備：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用進階灌注台升級、移除和調整已附魔物品上的附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">❤️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以經驗修復：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">直接使用等級恢復耐久度，無需消耗修復材料。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">♻️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">回收經驗：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">對不需要的物品進行解除附魔，並回收經驗，類似於砂輪。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">也可附魔書本：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">直接透過灌注台製作附魔書，打造你的完美圖書館。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擴展附魔選項：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可選擇允許通常僅限於鐵砧的附魔，例如將鋒利附魔應用在斧頭上。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎛️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高度可自訂：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">自訂費用、書櫃需求、修復機制、可用附魔等眾多設定。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔描述：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-insights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Enchantment Insights</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組，即可在灌注台介面中直接檢視附魔描述。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cATWWPwhay4\" height=\"480\" width=\"854\"></iframe></span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客戶端與伺服器端皆需安裝</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模組支援，可直接在遊戲內使用模組選單進行設定（需安裝 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，作者為 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，Fabric 平台適用）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有檔案位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，依設定類型命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。不同模組可能不存在所有類型的設定檔。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/freyadono\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Freyadono</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 創作了原始的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Enchanting Plus</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組，我多年前很喜歡玩，並且它對這個專案有深遠的啟發。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/releasehun\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">releaseHUN</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 為模組創作了精美的材質貼圖。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lorddeathunter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">LordDeatHunter</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Wraith Waystones</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組，啟發了附魔灌注台介面的部分設計。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shxrkie\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">SHXRKIE</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 在開發過程中提供的所有幫助和反饋。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tradingpost/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-invasion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/name-tag-upgrade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/nametagupgrade/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/let-me-sleep\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delete-worlds-to-trash\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/deleteworldstotrash/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-enchants\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natural-waters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/naturalwaters/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/locked-in-slots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/lockedinslots/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
